import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="About this site — Down Together"
  description="Who we are, which sources we use, how content is generated and reviewed, and how to report an error."
>
  <h1>About this site</h1>

  <h2>Why it exists</h2>
  <p>
    Down Together was born from a personal experience: when a
    Down syndrome diagnosis arrives, clear, current information in your own
    language isn't always easy to find. This site gathers, in both Spanish
    and English, content based on verified sources.
  </p>

  <h2>Sources we use</h2>
  <p>We only cite and rely on recognized Down syndrome and public health organizations:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>National Down Syndrome Society (NDSS) — United States</li>
    <li>National Down Syndrome Congress (NDSC) — United States</li>
    <li>Down's Syndrome Association (DSA) — United Kingdom</li>
    <li>Canadian Down Syndrome Society (CDSS) — Canada</li>
    <li>Down España — Spanish Down Syndrome Federation</li>
    <li>Fundación Iberoamericana Down21</li>
    <li>CDC — Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (US)</li>
    <li>NICHD — National Institute of Child Health and Human Development (US)</li>
    <li>PubMed — peer-reviewed scientific literature</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How content is generated</h2>
  <p>
    Every article is drafted with Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant), which
    searches the sources above, synthesizes the information, and cites the
    original source. <strong>No article is published without human
    review</strong>: every draft goes through editorial review before
    approval, and is explicitly marked as reviewed in the article's own file.
  </p>
  <p>
    This content doesn't replace medical consultation. For health topics, we
    describe what the sources say and recommend consulting a professional for
    personal decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Found an error?</h2>
  <p>
    If something looks incorrect or outdated, write to us at
    <a href="mailto:hola@downtogether.org">hola@downtogether.org</a> — we'll
    review and correct it as soon as possible.
  </p>
</Layout>
